  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently it is possible to specify an exact grip on a VRC_Pickup object. However, since there is such a disparity between how much control VR users and desktop users have over their hands, it would make sense to be able to specify these grip positions separately.\n\nA simple use case for this is a shield item that the player can pickup. For a desktop user, it is necessary to place the shield facing forward out from their outstretched hand. However, for VR users, it makes more sense to have the shield positioned on the back of their hand as a shield is normally held.\n\nThis feature would simply add additional transform positions for ExactGunDesktop and ExactGripDesktop to the VRC_Pickup component allowing separate transform objects to be specified for desktop and VR users.",
